  ── material properties (the ring as a mathematical material) ──
    macrocycle: 4-membered ring, branched (a cross-linked network node on the ring)
    ring stability: weakest clean bond Δ=1.17 at junction 4→1 (only as stable as its weakest link); 1 junction(s) cross-link/addition, not one clean bond
    ring strain σ(Δ) = 0.342 — bonds unevenly loaded, internal stress stored (an anneal would relax it)
